: SOL, a stock or any of 580 pairs</small></span><small class="muted">loading pairs…</small></div><div class="two"><label>X <small>optional · one coin per account</small><input placeholder="@froglord" value=""/></label><label>telegram <small>optional</small><input placeholder="t.me/froglord" value=""/></label></div><label>website <small>optional</small><input placeholder="froglord.xyz" value=""/></label><button class="btn btn-big" data-wallet="loading"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg> <!-- -->create coin</button></form><aside class="lp-side"><div class="lp-preview"><span class="lp-tag mono">your coin on the board</span><article class="ccard" style="--i:0"><div class="cc-media"><div class="cc-pic noimg" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="cc-new">new</span></div><div class="cc-body"><div class="cc-top"><span class="cc-by" title="every coin is created by the one master wallet"><img class="markglyph" src="/brand/mark-64.png" alt="" width="13" height="13" draggable="false"/>master</span><span class="cc-age mono">0s ago</span><span class="grow"></span><span class="chg chg-up"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="11" height="11" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 14 6-6 6 6"></path></svg><span class="mono">0.0<!-- -->%</span></span></div><h3 class="cc-name"><span class="cc-nm">your coin</span><span class="cc-tick mono">$<!-- -->TICKER</span></h3><div class="cc-mc"><div class="cc-mcl"><span class="cc-lbl">market cap</span><b class="mono cc-mcv">$2.90k</b></div><svg class="spark spark-up" width="92" height="30" viewBox="0 0 92 30" aria-hidden="true"><defs><linearGradient id="sg_R_4rj5fiurdb_" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="currentColor" stop-opacity="0.32"></sto